UID:61a7ffbfc86f12a7185a4d504405b5dd8aa33cf5d64b6191972dc95ccf4cd695
CATEGORIES:cinema
DESCRIPTION:Hadoota (Ahmed Helmy)\, a 40-year-old thug\, can’t remember 
 the hiding place of a witness he kidnapped. He resorts to a hypnosis thera
